# Python
# ========================
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
*.egg-info/
/dist/
# Anchored to the repository root. Unanchored, "build/" also matched
# report/build/, which is the report generator's source — so the entire
# generator was silently untracked and a fresh clone would not have built the
# dissertation at all.
/build/
*.egg

